      "value": "Target packages by track type (NASCAR 2026 technical updates): ~670 hp intermediate; target 750 hp on road courses and ovals under 1.5 miles; restricted package on designated superspeedways"
    },
    {
      "key": "Track packages (2026)",
      "value": "Short-track / road-course package (3″ rear spoiler, fewer diffuser strakes, 750 hp target) used on road courses and ovals under 1.5 miles — including Bristol, Darlington, Dover, Nashville Superspeedway and World Wide Technology Raceway (Gateway) from 2026. Intermediate tracks use the higher-downforce / ~670 hp configuration (4″ spoiler in the short-track vs intermediate package contrast published with the 2026 updates). Superspeedways use the restricted package."
    },
